Subject: [PATCH v2 7/8] gpu: nova-core: remove redundant `.as_ref()` for `dev_*` print
Date: Fri, 23 Jan 2026 17:58:44 +0000
Message-ID: <20260123175854.176735-7-gary@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.51.2
